.                 
.                 local age_min = 18

.                 local age_max = 65

.                 local n_years = `age_max' - `age_min' + 1

.                 
.                 expand `n_years'
(2,041,069 observations created)

. 
.                 * Assign ages 18..65 deterministically within each unique per
> son.
.                 * (id, famid_orig, perid_orig) uniquely identifies a person h
> ere
.                 * (after the gduplicates drop above), so _n within that group
>  is
.                 * well-defined regardless of within-group sort order.
.                 sort id famid_orig perid_orig

.                 by id famid_orig perid_orig: gen age = `age_min' + _n - 1

.                 
.                 tempfile balanced_panel

.                 save `balanced_panel', replace
