. * Make decomposition plots
. capture program drop make_decomp_plots

. program define make_decomp_plots
  1. 
.         syntax, outcome(string)
  2.         * outcome = (amt,sh)
.         
.         capture gen zero = 0
  3. 
.         tw      area net_effect_snap pct, fcolor(ltblue) lwidth(none) || line
