. /***************************************************************************
>  * Appendix Figure A14: Self-Targeting by Number of Distinct Transfers Receiv
> ed
>  * 
>  * Description:
>  * This script estimates the predictive effect of transfer receipt on consump
> tion
>  * rank and lifetime-income rank, conditional on current-income rank. It prod
> uces
>  * the analysis in Figure A13 of the paper, distinguishing by the number of d
> istinct 
>  * transfers received.
>  * 
>  * Inputs:
>  * - PSID data (`"$dir/data/psid_base"`)
>  * - CEX data (`"$dir/data/cex/raw/workfile.dta"`)
>  * 
>  * Outputs:
>  * - Figure A14 (`"$dir/figures/multiple_receipt.pdf"`)
>  ***************************************************************************/
. 
. 
. * Load data
. 
.         do code/settings.do

. global imputation 0

