  9.         
.                 * Regression coefficients
.                 
.                 reg rk_c_current_eq `p' bs_rk* if eligsim_`p'==1 [pw=wtfam], 
> cl(famid_orig)
 10.                 mat b[`i',4] = _b[`p']
